# Two adjacent Champions, each pre-bonded to home (D8/D9 revised 2026-08-08 — 1 mana from turn
# 1) — combat, plus a small library for each so Bond and Draw are both exercisable here too, not
# just in casting-demo/terrain-bonding. Already adjacent, so combat needs no movement even though
# both Champions are now rooted to their own single-tile network.
seed 6
board 4x4

card test.champion Champion "Champion" attack=2 life=15 ap=7 abilities=core.move,core.attack,champion.bond,champion.draw,champion.collapse
card test.grunt Creature "Grunt" attack=3 life=5 ap=3 mana=2 abilities=core.move,core.attack

champion P1 test.champion 0,0
champion P2 test.champion 1,0

bond P1 0,0
bond P2 1,0

library P1 test.grunt,test.grunt
library P2 test.grunt,test.grunt
